|            |        |      | id function.                                    |
| LBR-76     |Warning |   16 |Detected both combinational and sequential       |
|            |        |      | timing arcs in a library cell. This might       |
|            |        |      | prevent the tool from using this cell for       |
|            |        |      | technology mapping. The tool will treat it as   |
|            |        |      | unusable.                                       |
